<title>UK: Ocean Group H1 profit rises 19 pct.</title>
<headline>Ocean Group H1 profit rises 19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 30</p>
<p>			  (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr (pence)		14.2		   vs 12.1</p>
<p>Dividend (pence)	 5.4		    vs 5.0</p>
<p>Pretax		     32.0		   vs 27.0</p>
<p>Turnover		   570.8		  vs 550.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 29.0 and 33.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Current H1 pretax results excluded a 230.8 million stg gain on the disposal of discontinued operations.</p>
<p>Full company name - Ocean Group Plc. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
